; A record for each letter. Each item (17 cards, from excp: its end card, n, and its run with an edge on each side)
; in; for a word for the rules (an item ended by -21 or -22), a record of 19 cards for each of its letters out: the
; number of the rule tables' record to fetch (the letter's code, or 0 for an apostrophe), the letter's place i, the
; word's length n, its end card and the word with its edges (15 cards, kept in cells 80-94). Anything else goes out
; as one record, with 0 to fetch, i and n 0, its end card and its cards. The host deals each record, but for its
; first card, with the records fetched for it, to left, right and pick.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            item    INP   end      03-19: an item: its cards into 80-94; a word for the rules, or not
  04                    INP   n
  05                    CLA   i80
  06                    STO   rd
  07            rd      DATA  0        (INP 80 + k)
  08                    CLA   rd
  09                    ADD   00
  10                    STO   rd
  11                    SUB   i95
  12                    TAC   rd
  13                    CLA   z
  14                    STO   i
  15                    CLA   end
  16                    ADD   c20
  17                    TAC   lett
  18            pass    CLA   z
  19                    STO   n
  20            lett    CLA   z        20-51: each letter's record (one for anything else)
  21                    STO   req
  22                    CLA   n
  23                    SUB   00
  24                    TAC   put
  25                    CLA   c81
  26                    ADD   i
  27                    STO   lc
  28            lc      DATA  0        (CLA 81 + i)
  29                    STO   req
  30                    SUB   c27
  31                    TAC   put
  32                    CLA   z
  33                    STO   req
  34            put     OUT   req
  35                    OUT   i
  36                    OUT   n
  37                    OUT   end
  38                    CLA   o80
  39                    STO   wo
  40            wo      DATA  0        (OUT 80 + k)
  41                    CLA   wo
  42                    ADD   00
  43                    STO   wo
  44                    SUB   o95
  45                    TAC   wo
  46                    CLA   i
  47                    ADD   00
  48                    STO   i
  49                    SUB   n
  50                    TAC   lett
  51                    JMP   item
  60            end     DATA  0
  61            n       DATA  0
  62            i       DATA  0
  63            req     DATA  0
  64            z       DATA  0
  65            c20     DATA  20
  67            c27     DATA  27
  68            i80     INP   80
  69            i95     INP   95
  70            c81     CLA   81
  71            o80     OUT   80
  72            o95     OUT   95
